Follow-ups to 0034 to 0036.
0034: a mesh pipeline without a PS keeps its color formats (they must match
the render pass) but gets write mask 0 and no blending, so nothing undefined
is written. The no-output fragment is looked up once in the internal library.
0035: attachment-free pipelines always use the command list's sample count,
also with ForcedSampleCount and Count 1.
0036: every access through the null pointer of a failed bound check is skipped:
DXIL loads, stores and atomics, DXBC raw and structured loads and stores.
Buffers without bounds metadata get no branch.

